    <briefdescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_eigen_types" kindref="compound">EigenTypes</ref></computeroutput> specialisation for arbitrary-precision real (<computeroutput>MPFR</computeroutput>) matrices. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Same logic as the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_r_r" kindref="compound">M2::ARingRR</ref></computeroutput> specialisation lifted to the MPFR/MPC rings: general spectra land in <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_c_c_c" kindref="compound">M2::ARingCCC</ref></computeroutput>, Hermitian spectra stay in <computeroutput><ref refid="class_m2_1_1_a_ring_r_r_r" kindref="compound">M2::ARingRRR</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
